<body>
    <h1>Claims / Grouping Rules</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"f981fc3e2bea">Coupe=E2=80=99s claims adjudication sy=
stem operates under a system that ultimately adjudicates a health claim to =
a single benefit/copay. This is done through several processes to approach =
the final outcome of the claim.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5c2c21324a7a">First, each line of a claim is assigned its ow=
n rule number based on matching the filter criteria of the rule. These rule=
s are managed via an Excel spreadsheet with a series of AND/OR statements t=
hat reference the datapoints on the claim. These spreadsheet uploads requir=
e in depth knowledge of several mapping tables which makes it difficult for=
 business owners to understand.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"965f75838b16" id=3D"Claims/GroupingRules-Common/ValidatedCl=
aim=E2=86=92MatchedClaims">Common/ValidatedClaim =E2=86=92 MatchedClaims</h=
1>
<p local-id=3D"43e556def498" style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;"><em>Procs run: =
common.PreventiveRuleRunner, Common.RuleRunner</em></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"ae947ace-a848-46ca-88a1-d28bbe3d14c8">
<li local-id=3D"7a736350-d93d-48a2-952e-8fbed097c205">
<p local-id=3D"37d6d00e24e6">This is what we typically call our =E2=80=9Ccl=
aim rules=E2=80=9D, where various filters are applied to find claim lines t=
hat match those filters.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"50bd4f57-97b4-4afe-8065-9019c3024ae1">
<p local-id=3D"918073204346">The claim will go through two sets of rules, p=
reventive and non-preventive</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"b8602f9d1ce4" id=3D"Claims/GroupingRules-PreventiveRules"><=
strong>Preventive Rules</strong></h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"79659e7a-c04f-44ac-bf1a-0abb430ca5db">
<li local-id=3D"4be77d91-0de9-4cc0-ab6f-0a56d1386762">
<p local-id=3D"69876e238499">Run before non-preventive rules and are a comp=
letely separate set of rules</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"7e387b30-6dad-4fa1-9586-cf66a2b9158b">
<li local-id=3D"6a741cd1-bfee-4b71-811c-8321b2bb1813">
<p local-id=3D"4c6b3da52b4f">Depending on plan partner, a claim could have =
either =E2=80=9Cfull or partial=E2=80=9D preventive</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"b7e0906b-0e1f-42ae-b41c-86ed4555e104">
<li local-id=3D"fa5b9f86-3866-4b9b-a80b-5709b82a6c45">
<p local-id=3D"04faff1ab78d">Full Preventive - If one single line of a clai=
m matches a preventive rule, then the whole claim is considered preventive<=
/p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"518a3c66-c7d7-4428-b415-d42e946db93a">
<li local-id=3D"99c05a15-ed7e-49c1-a7bb-f2be325a4585">
<p local-id=3D"5d78ee0a0836">Ex: Meritain and BCBSAL</p></li>
</ol></li>
<li local-id=3D"4bcb2d8f-c25c-49ca-812b-1baa944dbb2d">
<p local-id=3D"e0a3c4753c48">Partial Preventive - In order for a claim to b=
e marked preventive, all services on the claim must be preventive</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"5d680179-1ab2-41fc-a048-c6c4846f849f">
<li local-id=3D"4fd82874-b608-498f-867e-9c3b1da41bdb">
<p local-id=3D"f94382c78d3f">Ex: Ameriben and National Alliance</p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"6540b2e181ee" id=3D"Claims/GroupingRules-Non-PreventiveRule=
s"><strong>Non-Preventive Rules</strong></h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"c5d8f7ad-7db0-421b-b587-77c0776b87a9">
<li local-id=3D"c64c3511-dd99-41ac-8124-c53766c96107">
<p local-id=3D"50924ef13566">Run after preventive rules</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5e2032a1-b3fc-4e03-b9f0-ed81b796e899">
<p local-id=3D"5365453134da">Each claim line is assigned a rule number and =
a rule rank</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"88170e2b-6041-46f8-92c7-a72d4ab99b16">
<p local-id=3D"b60001e919e5">Each rule has an outcomeBenefitCode associated=
 with it.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"2c135244eff3" id=3D"Claims/GroupingRules-KeyfieldsforRuleRu=
nner">Key fields for Rule Runner</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e6=
ae8eb5-0c73-4114-829b-caefd2de4252" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5f0fcc31-2fe0-4753-aad4-9d622ee38773">
<th data-local-id=3D"ac6432a8-2499-4ec1-b425-8baa78b809fe" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"78c02194e1ee"><strong>Field</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a03a3ff2-c365-40ec-88aa-8d19b25a7e21" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"546feea6417d"><strong>Definition</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"9e34383c-fd9a-4fe7-a0d8-3dc3af4a0266" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4e9bac2c40f9"><strong>Example</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3c7983d3-7cdf-44b3-bb82-a947d9eb4715">
<td data-local-id=3D"46e83013-63dd-46e5-b6ca-84e8bd972bee" class=3D"conflue=
