<hr local-id=3D"4920eae9-2dd0-4fcc-86bd-b6daa0339e34">
<h1 local-id=3D"1d70c6686a60" id=3D"Claims/GroupingRules-Node5-ClaimRollupL=
ogic">Node 5 - Claim Rollup Logic</h1>
<p local-id=3D"47ad8e495f79">This is where Nected's Flow is valuable.</p>
<p local-id=3D"bcda3f4a6fcd">Current process:</p>
<p local-id=3D"fbed04395767">For each line:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">find fi=
rst matching rule
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"f0425c9663dd">Then:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">claimRe=
sult =3D
line with lowest RuleRank
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"f5a48f34a5e2">Instead create two outputs:</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"9212b8a19558" id=3D"Claims/GroupingRules-LineEvaluation">Li=
ne Evaluation</h3>
<p local-id=3D"b4108714be65">For each line:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
  "matchedBenefitCode": 16,
  "matchedPriority": 37
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"2b705f8364db" id=3D"Claims/GroupingRules-Aggregation">Aggre=
gation</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f7a52b34b0aa">Then Flow performs:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: sql; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">MIN(matc=
hedPriority)</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"8a51e9a76fe8"></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
  claimBenefitCode,
  triggeringLine,
  triggeringRule
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"a379b0d3-b532-46d1-8594-630f9237023d">
<h1 local-id=3D"f39279284160" id=3D"Claims/GroupingRules-BiggestOpportunity=
">Biggest Opportunity</h1>
<p local-id=3D"ebd0b54f3309">The spreadsheet is really mixing <strong>three=
 concerns</strong>:</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"ba7dba49e8bb" id=3D"Claims/GroupingRules-Concern1">Concern =
1</h3>
